# Build artifacts and per-machine state. Mirrored here (in addition to the
# repo-root .gitignore) so Tailwind's content scanner — which reads .gitignore
# at the source root — skips them. Without this, locally-generated browser
# profile HTML under .airglow/ gets scanned, inflating the dashboard CSS.
.output/
.wxt/
.airglow/
.env
.env.local
